# Compass environment variables
#
# Phase 1 (the solver) requires none of these -- the solver is pure TypeScript
# with no I/O. They are listed now so the file tracks the stack as it lands.
#
# Phase 2 (data + auth) will require:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#
# Server-only. Never expose this to the browser, never prefix it NEXT_PUBLIC_:
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
#
# Server-only. Used by Drizzle for migrations:
# DATABASE_URL=
